workplan/2026-10-30-ramp-spec-pages/RENDER-DECISIONS-AND-PIPELINE.md:107:| C11 | Standards (T4–T6) cannot anchor best practice vs owner's gentlest-value rule | Largely resolved by Option A (2026-07-21); see section 7, correction 1 and ledger 2026-10-30, item 1. Closed: the owner confirmed the ○ band and flag stay (ledger 2026-10-30 second) |
