workplan/2026-10-30-ramp-spec-pages/reports/spec-page-design-requirements-2026-10-29.md:96:10. **Accessible, always.** (Owner, mid-session: "all work must comply with website accessibility standards and best practices.") WCAG 2.2 level AA is the floor, with the cognitive (COGA) guidance the project already adopted in `governance/armature_v3_review.md` §6. Accessibility is a precondition for every other tenet, not a trade-off against them; where a design choice and an accessibility rule conflict, the rule wins.
