workplan/2026-11-12-bidirectional-pipeline/tasks/T-017-wp-t2-conditions.md:225:**Why B4 is not the report's B4.** The report's B4 (`1:15` unconditioned plus a conditioned `1:12`, expect `100/15`) cannot go red on its value: under `lower_is_better` the lowest ceiling is `1:15` with or without the edge, so only its note distinguishes the two engines. This B4 is a probe whose **value** differs (the conditioned claim is the one the most-accommodating rule would pick, under the other direction), and B7 is the note-only probe, on a decline path, stated as such.
